(7524412, 1202635, 173844, '<td valign="top">Though I suspect his/her parents will return momentarily, as it stands there''s nothing else in this challenge so achingly lonely.  The clarity of down, skin eye and beak is terrific.</td>', 'Though I suspect his/her parents will return momentarily, as it stands there''s nothing else in this challenge so achingly lonely.  The clarity of down, skin eye and beak is terrific.', '2017-07-19 18:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524414, 1202688, 173844, '<td valign="top">Can''t understand why he''d be lonely looking into this enchanting expanse, but okay.  Taking it from there, this is a vastly enjoyable landscape.</td>', 'Can''t understand why he''d be lonely looking into this enchanting expanse, but okay.  Taking it from there, this is a vastly enjoyable landscape.', '2017-07-19 18:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524458, 1202665, 173844, '<td valign="top">The choice of a very lonely setting --  landscape, blown out sky, witch''s broom  - set the stage for this young boy''s demoralized appearance.  Very strong entry. If the challenge had been "Hangdog", this would win hands (and head) down.</td>', 'The choice of a very lonely setting --  landscape, blown out sky, witch''s broom  - set the stage for this young boy''s demoralized appearance.  Very strong entry. If the challenge had been "Hangdog", this would win hands (and head) down.', '2017-07-20 13:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524459, 1202728, 173844, '<td valign="top">The dark foreground and rather lighter mid- and background seemingly deny the viewer any place to light, and so the bird sails on.  Effective blend of loneliness and discomfort.</td>', 'The dark foreground and rather lighter mid- and background seemingly deny the viewer any place to light, and so the bird sails on.  Effective blend of loneliness and discomfort.', '2017-07-20 13:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
