(7524464, 1202430, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lonely --  or pensive, nostalgic, thinking of the next meal.  The open space makes the case, I guess, so we can travel along the photographer''s vision.  The centered horizon isn''t helpful, otherwise I like its peacefulness.</td>', 'Lonely --  or pensive, nostalgic, thinking of the next meal.  The open space makes the case, I guess, so we can travel along the photographer''s vision.  The centered horizon isn''t helpful, otherwise I like its peacefulness.', '2017-07-20 13:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524465, 1202357, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting compositional balance, interplay of bright light and shadow.</td>', 'Interesting compositional balance, interplay of bright light and shadow.', '2017-07-20 13:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524466, 1202678, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yeah, you''ve really hit upon a sadness for so many pets and owners.  The adroit placement of the dog and the befuddled floor and furniture beautifully distill the moment.  Very well done,</td>', 'Yeah, you''ve really hit upon a sadness for so many pets and owners.  The adroit placement of the dog and the befuddled floor and furniture beautifully distill the moment.  Very well done,', '2017-07-20 13:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524467, 1202727, 173844, '<td valign="top">Admirably simple and complex.  She''s deep in a corner wrapped within a featureless ocean. The limited palette contributes to the lonely mood.  Very nice.</td>', 'Admirably simple and complex.  She''s deep in a corner wrapped within a featureless ocean. The limited palette contributes to the lonely mood.  Very nice.', '2017-07-20 13:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524473, 1202265, 173844, '<td valign="top">Deep emotion expressed with the stoic restraint of a Chinese or Japanese watercolor painting.  The branches even hint at calligraphy.  Exceptional.</td>', 'Deep emotion expressed with the stoic restraint of a Chinese or Japanese watercolor painting.  The branches even hint at calligraphy.  Exceptional.', '2017-07-20 13:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524479, 1202686, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excellent image.  Hopefully they have years of companionship ahead of them.</td>', 'Excellent image.  Hopefully they have years of companionship ahead of them.', '2017-07-20 14:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524480, 1202317, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.</td>', 'Nicely composed.', '2017-07-20 14:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524482, 1202690, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice lines (no pun intended) and simplicity.</td>', 'Nice lines (no pun intended) and simplicity.', '2017-07-20 14:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7524699, 1202678, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes, I see you. This is very nearly the only entry where I can find even a mildly ambitious attempt at the figurative; at expressing what loneliness represents, how it feels and tastes.  At saying just how big some small things are.<br/> <br/>I''m normally an uncomplaining and extravagantly tolerant bloke (I''m noted for it, surely?), but it''s so depressing to see entry after entry in which aloneness is depicted as if it were synonymous with loneliness.  It''s OK to be imaginatively bankrupt, but please keep it to yourselves!<br/> <br/>I don''t mean you of course; you still have a few bucks in your imagination &amp; whimsy account, as evidenced here.  I was just hijacking your entry in order to have a bit of a rant.  Thank you for hosting my tantrum.  <br/> <br/>And as for your entry, it''s welcome and interesting, and it stimulates some reflection on the part of the viewer.  So ... it''s 10 for you. Thank you.<br/> <br/>P.S. Did you find this?  I slipped it under your door.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Yes, I see you. This is very nearly the only entry where I can find even a mildly ambitious attempt at the figurative; at expressing what loneliness represents, how it feels and tastes.  At saying just how big some small things are. I''m normally an uncomplaining and extravagantly tolerant bloke (I''m noted for it, surely?), but it''s so depressing to see entry after entry in which aloneness is depicted as if it were synonymous with loneliness.  It''s OK to be imaginatively bankrupt, but please keep it to yourselves! I don''t mean you of course; you still have a few bucks in your imagination & whimsy account, as evidenced here.  I was just hijacking your entry in order to have a bit of a rant.  Thank you for hosting my tantrum.   And as for your entry, it''s welcome and interesting, and it stimulates some reflection on the part of the viewer.  So ... it''s 10 for you. Thank you. P.S. Did you find this?  I slipped it under your door.', '2017-07-21 12:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
