(7524912, 1202575, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this works.  I tried to decide if it would still work without the title, but that''s futile because it <i>has </i>the title; that''s part of what it means, what it is.  It''s like trying to decide if the Beatles'' album Revolver was still good without the title.  Probably.  Probably not.  It''s academic because the title is part of it, QED. This is about loneliness. 9. Thank you.</td>', 'Yeah, this works.  I tried to decide if it would still work without the title, but that''s futile because it has the title; that''s part of what it means, what it is.  It''s like trying to decide if the Beatles'' album Revolver was still good without the title.  Probably.  Probably not.  It''s academic because the title is part of it, QED. This is about loneliness. 9. Thank you.', '2017-07-23 07:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
