(7525205, 1202510, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>A simple image that conveys a feeling of loneliness and isolation but more than that it portrays the stress that results from the pressure school children are subjected to at this time of year with all their exams. I like your low level viewpoint and shallow DOF to isolate the person and their belongings it works well. I dont know if it was posed or an opportunist moment, nevertheless it still gets the message over, well done Marcel</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge well. A simple image that conveys a feeling of loneliness and isolation but more than that it portrays the stress that results from the pressure school children are subjected to at this time of year with all their exams. I like your low level viewpoint and shallow DOF to isolate the person and their belongings it works well. I dont know if it was posed or an opportunist moment, nevertheless it still gets the message over, well done Marcel', '2017-07-24 11:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525221, 1202718, 101668, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. I voted 10 that''s how beautiful this is</td>', 'Wonderful. I voted 10 that''s how beautiful this is', '2017-07-24 13:31:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525236, 1202688, 172697, '<td valign="top">Thank you Guys :)</td>', 'Thank you Guys :)', '2017-07-24 13:45:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525241, 1202726, 50641, '<td valign="top">poor tripod! bereft.  not even getting any sunshine.  plus someone poured water on the photographer and then all the color melted out of oz.   would like to see this in its original emerald one day.</td>', 'poor tripod! bereft.  not even getting any sunshine.  plus someone poured water on the photographer and then all the color melted out of oz.   would like to see this in its original emerald one day.', '2017-07-24 14:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
